/usr/include/qt5/QtCore/qbytearray.h:74:27: error: ‘size_t strlen(const char*)’ reading 1 or more bytes from a region of size 0 [-Werror=stringop-overread]
   74 | { return str ? uint(strlen(str)) : 0; }
      |                     ~~~~~~^~~~~
In file included from /usr/include/qt5/QtCore/qbytearray.h:46:
/usr/include/qt5/QtCore/qarraydata.h: In member function ‘void AboutDialog::updateWiresharkText()’:
